Z||000001||batboy||10-20-1999||08:46 PM||||Hey Eddie, thanks for asking! Between a business trip, a vacation, and unexpected repairs to my 85 GT...I haven't got back to finishing the Batmobile's front end. I had to order the tie rods and steering stabilizer since nothing locally had Moog parts in stock, but the parts are supposed to be in tomorrow (Oct. 21), so I hope to finish the job by this weekend. Looks like it's almost 2 inches lower than before. The bummer is that the back end looks too high now. I'll post my results after a road test. My parents gave me a digital camera last weekend, so I'll post some pics too.||||reg||1
